DISCLAIMER & RESPONSIBLE USE
============================

This software operates a FURUI NFC PM-Pro (FR-RATEL) RFID reader/writer and can
read, write, clone, and recover keys from 125 kHz and 13.56 MHz (Mifare Classic)
cards. It is provided for:

  * interoperability with hardware you own,
  * administration of access systems you operate,
  * security research and education, and
  * authorized penetration testing.

USE IT ONLY on cards, fobs, and systems that you own or are explicitly
authorized to test. Reading, cloning, or modifying credentials you do not own or
are not authorized to access may be illegal in your jurisdiction.

The protocol details were determined by clean-room reverse engineering for
interoperability; they document functional facts about the device's wire
protocol. Legal treatment of reverse engineering, anti-circumvention, and
security tooling varies by country — you are responsible for compliance with the
laws that apply to you.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. The authors are
not liable for any damage, data loss, bricked devices, or misuse. Writing to
